- Setting: tower_ui_cache

v1.25 - Big Dick Randy Mode
- Uses big_dick_randy.png and big_dick_randy.wav
- Random appearances every 5-15 minutes
- Impossible to disable (stop function does nothing, non-daemon thread)
- Random position on screen
- Fade in/out effects
- Audio playback on appearance
