- Settings: big_dick_randy_mode, bdr_min_interval, bdr_max_interval, bdr_duration
- Dependencies: pygame

v1.26 - Veto Behavior Fix
- First veto: Click veto once, wait 0.3s, click veto again, redo map selection
- Second veto: Do NOT click veto again, use ESC, L, ENTER (0.15s delay each)
- This is an alternative to full rejoin protocol

v1.27 - Leave Detection Fix
- After clicking Leave, waits for blue Play triangle
- Clicks it 3 times (0.3s delay between clicks)
- Then waits for green PLAY
- Then gamemode selection and Ready

v1.28 - Second Veto Logic Fix
- Removed veto clicking after second detection
- Goes directly to ESC, L, ENTER sequence
- Makes sense since you're leaving anyway

