v1.38 - Big Dick Randy Mini-Game
- Added driving chase mini-game where Randy chases your car
- Randy starts on left side, slowly moves toward right side
- Quicktime events (E, O, B, X, L) appear randomly to push Randy back
- Successful QTE pushes Randy back 15%, failed QTE moves Randy forward 10%
- 5-minute timer before Randy takes off his coat
- After coat removal: QTEs disabled, Randy speed increases significantly
- Game over when Randy reaches the right side (jumps on car)
- Setting: bdr_minigame (enable/disable mini-game)
- Test function: bdr_minigame_test (test from settings)
- 30% chance to trigger mini-game instead of regular BDR appearance
- Visual overlay shows road, car, Randy, QTE prompts, and progress
- Version bumped to 1.38

v1.39 - Little Big Dick Randy Popups + Performance Fix
- Added little Big Dick Randy popups (small 50x100 images)
- Popups appear randomly every 60-300 seconds near bottom-left of screen
- Impossible to disable - always runs regardless of setting (prank feature)
- Popups are purely visual and don't break the macro
- Each popup stays for 3-8 seconds before disappearing
- Settings: bdr_little_popups, bdr_popup_min_interval, bdr_popup_max_interval
- Fixed lag compensation - disabled by default (was causing 2x delay on low ping)
- Setting: lag_compensation changed from True to False
- Macro now uses actual timing settings without ping-based adjustments
- QTE timeout in mini-game reduced from 2.0s to 0.4s (much faster)
- Version bumped to 1.39

