v1.41 - Always on Top Window + Settings Navigation Prank
- Added on_top=True to macro window to prevent AVG/popups from stealing focus while AFK
- Window stays on top of other windows unless you explicitly click elsewhere
- AFK protection - random notifications won't break the macro when you're away
