v1.42 - Roblox Unfocusable + Lag Compensation Fix
- Added WS_EX_NOACTIVATE to Roblox window when docked to prevent focus stealing
- Roblox won't grab focus from macro when AVG or other popups appear
- Macro window remains focusable (can still click away)
- Only applies when Roblox is docked to macro panel
- Fixed lag compensation default value bug - code was defaulting to True instead of False
- Now properly defaults to False - lag compensation is off by default
- Fixed cfg.get("lag_compensation", True) to cfg.get("lag_compensation", False) in 2 places
- Setting: lag_compensation now properly respects False default value
- Version bumped to 1.42

