v1.49 - Preflight System, Detection Diagnostics, One-Click Rollback
- Added preflight system - validate before starting macro
- Checks required images (9 TDS images must exist)
- Validates profile structure and detects corruption
- Verifies recording exists for custom mode
- Checks Roblox window accessibility
- Warns if resolution is below recommended (1920x1080)
- Auto-run on start option (preflight_on_start setting)
- Blocks macro start if critical issues found
- Reports all issues and warnings in log
- Added detection diagnostics mode - debugging aid
- Shows confidence scores for each detection
- Shows why detection was accepted or rejected
- Rate-limited to 1 message per second (avoids log spam)
- Tracks template names in diagnostics output
- Added one-click rollback system
- Automatic config snapshots (config_snapshot_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.json)
- Configurable snapshot count (default 5, max 20)
- Auto-cleanup of old snapshots
- Restore from any snapshot via API
- Creates backup before restoring (safety net)
- List all available snapshots
- New "Preflight & Diagnostics" section in Settings UI
- Settings: preflight_check, preflight_on_start
- Settings: diagnostics_mode, diagnostics_show_confidence, diagnostics_show_reason
- Settings: rollback_enabled, rollback_snapshots
- API methods: run_preflight, create_rollback_snapshot, list_rollback_snapshots, restore_rollback_snapshot
